{
  "method_ids": [
    "ct",
    "glm"
  ],
  "id": "ct-glm-constraint-control",
  "title": {
    "ja": "CTの初期制約保持とGLMの能動的cleaning：非物理診断対照",
    "en": "Initial-constraint preservation by CT and active GLM cleaning: nonphysical control"
  },
  "summary": {
    "ja": "故意にdiv B≠0とした同じcell磁場で、CTが初期違反を除去しないこととGLMのB/ψ応答を確認します。物理問題数へ加算しない診断対照です。",
    "en": "Intentionally begin with the same non-solenoidal cell B, checking that CT does not remove the initial defect and calibrating GLM’s B/psi response. This diagnostic adds no physical problem."
  },
  "assumptions": {
    "ja": "32²周期格子、t=.1、128刻み、ρ=p=1、v=0、By=ψ=0。CT face Bx=.01cos[2π(i+1)/32]、GLM cell Bxはその左右face平均と同一です。CT初期native div≠0は意図的に無効な物理初期値で、CTの正しい物理計算例とは区別します。",
    "en": "Periodic32² grid,t=.1,128 steps,rho=p=1,v=0,By=psi=0. CT faceBx=.01cos[2pi(i+1)/32]; GLM cellBx equals the adjacent-face average. The intentional nonzero native CT divergence violates valid physical CT initial data and is treated solely as a diagnostic."
  },
  "algorithm": {
    "ja": "同じ完全結合MHDコードを使用。y不変・By=vy=0ではGLMのBx/ψ系が流体応答から独立するため、離散Fourier記号の2×2行列と前進Euler行列冪を別に構成します。κ=2とκ=0を同じdt・LLF粘性で比較し、Bxだけの減少を物理減衰と取り違えません。",
    "en": "Use the same fully coupled MHD code. With y-invariance andBy=vy=0, the GLM Bx/psi subsystem decouples from fluid feedback, allowing a separately constructed2x2 discrete Fourier symbol and forward-Euler matrix power. Compare kappa2/0 at identical dt and LLF viscosity, separating B/psi phase exchange from physical damping."
  },
  "validation": {
    "ja": "CT native divの初期違反保持、GLMのψ励起、Bx/ψ双方の独立FE参照一致、密度・圧力正値性、物理的総E/質量保存を確認。補助波エネルギーW=〈Bx²+ψ²/ch²〉のκ2/κ0比を判定し、半離散行列指数と連続Fourier解も区別して表示します。",
    "en": "Check preservation of the initial CT defect, nonzero GLM psi, independent FE agreement for bothBx/psi, positive density/pressure, and conserved physical E/mass. Test the kappa2/0 ratio of auxiliary wave energy W=mean(Bx²+psi²/ch²), separating FE, semidiscrete-exponential and continuum-Fourier references."
  },
  "limits": {
    "ja": "対照の合格は「期待したCTの非除去とGLMの線形応答を正しく検出した」という意味です。非零CT divを許す物理計算を推奨しません。Wは診断用ノルムで、ψを含まない物理的総エネルギーEとは別です。GLMのBx減少には位相交換とLLF拡散も含まれ、κ0対照なしに減衰成功とは呼びません。一般非線形・境界流出・衝撃波のcleaning性能へ広げません。",
    "en": "Passing means correctly detecting expected CT non-removal and the calibrated GLM response, not recommending non-solenoidal CT physical initial data. W is an auxiliary diagnostic norm, distinct from conserved physical total energy E without psi. B decay includes phase exchange and LLF diffusion; damping is assessed with the kappa0 control. No general nonlinear,boundary or shock cleaning guarantee is claimed."
  },
  "references": [
    {
      "id": "dedner2002",
